			"Message": "docs(Grove): Document shim compatibility in Architecture.md\n\nAdd a Shim Compatibility section to the Architecture documentation describing how Grove supports the Land deep-shim interception system. The section covers the two-tier shim architecture (🟠 Low-Level at the JavaScript prototype level and 🔵 Coverage at the application service level), the corresponding `TierShim` env var values (`Own|Preempt` vs `Proxy|Replace`), and clarifies that no shim-specific modules exist in Grove — events route through `Wind`/`Mountain`/`Cocoon`.\n\nThis fills a documentation gap identified during the ongoing deep-shim integration work across the Element tree.",
			"SHA": "6fd87a4f5e3cf2470b691fa688bd8c4f66c27fde"
		},
