			],
			"Message": "style(Grove): Normalize dash style in README.md\n\nReplace em dashes with regular hyphens across the README for consistency with standard Markdown list and table formatting conventions. Em dashes were used in numbered-list items, key feature descriptions, the security table, and related documentation links.\n\n- Numbered goals: \"Provide Native Extension Hosting —\" → \"Provide Native Extension Hosting -\"\n- Key Feature headings: \"WASM Runtime Integration —\" → \"WASM Runtime Integration -\"\n- Security table rows: \"no unsafe code permitted —\" → \"no unsafe code permitted -\"\n- Related Documentation links: descriptive divider\n\nThis is a pure formatting pass with no runtime behavior changes.",
			"SHA": "a9fad44f84e1cbba76a20c2a357d1ae143533650"
		},
